Z||000000||2xsess||03-17-2001||04:29 PM||||No, not a bad day.<P>It seems like my GT has been feeling really spunky lately. It all started on Friday. I just now realized it might be because I had put 89 octane in it last week because all the other pumps were full and I was in a hurry, and on wednesday I got more if the usual 93 octane. That could be it.<BR>Oh well, just some useless rambling on.<BR>Just makes me smile when I put my foot in it and hear that rumble and feel a nudge back in my seat.<P>Anyone else have a Fiero that seems to be tempermental?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>  <B>*For Sale*<BR>        $2000obo</B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">        <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cheever2||03-17-2001||04:55 PM||||Some people say it doesn't matter, but I swear both my 4 cyl and 6 cyl do better with 93.||||reg||6
